{"id":"n69528-1-9","stage":2,"title":"웬일 · 什么事","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n69528-1-9-1","ko":"자네가 여기에는 웬일이야?","zh":"你怎会在这里啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"자네가","meaning":"你","explanation":"자네：你；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"자네","audio":"/audio/aa7a1b1564db7cda8172.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70797","senseId":"1","lemma":"자네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"여기에는","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"웬일이야?","meaning":"什么事，怎么回事，不知为什么","explanation":"웬일：什么事，怎么回事，不知为什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"웬일","audio":"/audio/9641672a10627d984dbd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69528","senseId":"1","lemma":"웬일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"aa7a1b1564db7cda","term":"자네","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/aa7a1b1564db7cda8172.mp3","entryId":"70797","definition":"(敬语)听者为朋友或晚辈时用来指称听者。","pronunciation":["자네"]},{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"9641672a10627d98","term":"웬일","zh":"什么事，怎么回事，不知为什么","audio":"/audio/9641672a10627d984dbd.mp3","entryId":"69528","definition":"怎么回事；或指什么样的事。","pronunciation":["웬ː닐"]}],"audio":"/audio/a93da872d2d5ad12c66d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n69528-1-9-2","ko":"마침 들를 일이 있어 왔어.","zh":"刚好有事情要处理，所以就过来了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"마침","meaning":"正好，正巧","explanation":"마침：正好，正巧","readings":[{"term":"마침","audio":"/audio/4b10fb22324c4af9aef0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56109","senseId":"1","lemma":"마침","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들를","meaning":"顺便去一下","explanation":"들르다：顺便去一下；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"들르다","audio":"/audio/3f6dc717f37be815b110.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67876","senseId":"1","lemma":"들르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일이","meaning":"事，工作","explanation":"일：事，工作；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"5","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있어","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왔어.","meaning":"来","explanation":"오다：来；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"4b10fb22324c4af9","term":"마침","zh":"正好，正巧","audio":"/audio/4b10fb22324c4af9aef0.mp3","entryId":"56109","definition":"很偶然地与某个机会或情况恰好吻合。","pronunciation":["마침"]},{"id":"3f6dc717f37be815","term":"들르다","zh":"顺便去一下","audio":"/audio/3f6dc717f37be815b110.mp3","entryId":"67876","definition":"路过时进去逗留一会儿。","pronunciation":["들르다"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事，工作","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"需要解决或处理的问题或事项。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"将要完成或进行某件事情。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了某个目的或事情而从别的地方移动到这里。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/99db796b709f4c204e32.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.73,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=69528","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.